# Rux16 default BIOS flash resource.
# Words are parsed as u16 values and written little-endian to per-computer bios.flash.
# This seed BIOS displays a no-boot-device screen and remains resident by looping.

e001 0000 1000 1101 5012
e001 0310 1000 1101 5012
e201 0314 1000 e301 0310 1000 1402

e101 004e 0000 5212 5342
